    {
      "source": "Create a SourceFilteringListener for the given event source,\nexpecting subclasses to override the <a href=\"#onApplicationEventInternal(org.springframework.context.ApplicationEvent)\"><code>onApplicationEventInternal(ApplicationEvent)</code></a>\nmethod (instead of specifying a delegate listener).",
      "translation": "为给定的事件源创建一个 SourceFilteringListener，期望子类重写<a href=\"#onApplicationEventInternal(org.springframework.context.ApplicationEvent)\"><code>onApplicationEventInternal(ApplicationEvent)</code></a>方法（而不是指定委托监听器）。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>source</code> - the event source that this listener filters for,\nonly processing events from this source",
      "translation": "<code>source</code> - 此监听器用于过滤的事件源，仅处理来自该源的事件",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Can also be used as base class, overriding the <a href=\"#onApplicationEventInternal(org.springframework.context.ApplicationEvent)\"><code>onApplicationEventInternal(ApplicationEvent)</code></a>\nmethod instead of specifying a delegate listener.",
